safety. When the tool is your finger, the resistance that usually starts before you even begin — just doesn't.</span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggUBLlfBle8_text","label":"ggUBLlfBle8_text","default":"2. <span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\"><strong>TEXTURE IS WHAT ACTUALLY REMOVES PLAQUE — NOT PASTE</strong></span>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggD4sCBXjJ8_text","label":"ggD4sCBXjJ8_text","default":"<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">Plaque is a sticky film. A smooth surface slides right over it. FreshWipes have a raised, textured surface that physically grips and lifts bacteria off the tooth. That's the step most products skip entirely — and why the problem keeps coming back.</span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggDHwZ6UpAu_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggDHwZ6UpAu_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0735/4833/3323/files/hf_20260501_065323_4f1cd1bf-ac2d-41a8-9c18-e73c1560e13d.png"},{"type":"html","id":"ggy8WEcXf6__srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggy8WEcXf6__srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0735/4833/3323/files/hf_20260501_064951_f6d98d61-008a-419f-8f0a-8d0b2b32ff95.png"},{"type":"html","id":"ggy8WEcXf6__srcSet_mobile_src","label":"ggy8WEcXf6__srcSet_mobile_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0735/4833/3323/files/hf_20260501_064951_f6d98d61-008a-419f-8f0a-8d0b2b32ff95.png"},{"type":"html","id":"ggpUmVIWk0y_text","label":"ggpUmVIWk0y_text","default":"3. <span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\"><strong>IT'S DONE IN 30 SECONDS BEFORE THEY DECIDE THEY HATE IT</strong></span>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggO4JaexPTG_text","label":"ggO4JaexPTG_text","default":"<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">Dogs build resistance over time. Give them 45 seconds and they've made up their mind. Finger wipes are done before that window closes. Fast enough that most dogs don't even register it as something to resist.</span></p>"}],
